SELECT 5 FROM [CLASS(MATH 1120), CLASS(MATH 1150), SELECT 1 FROM [SELECT 4 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 1610), CLASS(CHEM 1610L), CLASS(CHEM 1650), CLASS(CHEM 1650L)], SELECT 2 FROM [SELECT 1 FROM [SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 1740), CLASS(1740L)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 2200), CLASS(CHEM 2200L)]], SELECT 1 FROM [SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 1750), CLASS(CHEM 1750L)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 2210), CLASS(CHEM 2210L)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 2300), CLASS(CHEM 2300L)]]], SELECT 3 FROM [SELECT 1 FROM [SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 3320), CLASS(CHEM 3320L)], SELECT 2 FROM [CLASS(CHEM 3280), CLASS(CHEM 3280L)]], CLASS(CHEM 3330), CLASS(CHEM 3330L)]], CLASS(PHYS 1700), CLASS(PHYS 1710)] : "Prerequisites" : 1;
